<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>
    <!--
        The Commission is not one counter, and modelling it as one is the single
        most expensive mistake available here.

        A clerk does not go to "the Tax Commission". They go to قسم الشركات to
        file, to قسم الاستقطاع المباشر to remit, to قسم الحجوزات الضريبية for one
        stamp on the براءة ذمة walk, to القسم القانوني when the file is disputed
        and to لجنة الاستئناف when it is appealed. Each of those has its own
        queue, its own officers, its own opening behaviour and its own answer to
        "who is sitting on this". They are therefore sections of one body, which
        is what legal.gov.body.parent_id is for.

        Note that لجنة الاستئناف is a section here rather than a separate body.
        It sits inside the Commission, and an appeal that leaves the building is
        a cassation - which is a court, not a section, and is not shipped in this
        pack because the pack ends where the Commission does.
    -->
    <data noupdate="1">

